Package: PrevalentNewUser
Type: Package
Title: Prevalent New-User Cohort Design for OMOP CDM Data
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-10-27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bill", "O'Brien", , "willjobrien@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Observational Health Data Science and Informatics", role = c("cph"))
  )
Description: Implements the prevalent new-user (PNU) cohort design
    (Suissa et al. 2017 <doi:10.1002/pds.4117>) for data in the OMOP Common
    Data Model. The PNU design allows the reference treatment group to have
    already been exposed when index dates are defined, complementing
    CohortMethod which implements the active-comparator new-user design.
License: Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/ob325/PrevalentNewUser
BugReports: https://github.com/ob325/PrevalentNewUser/issues
